<div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-8 shadow-xl shadow-brand-900/5 ring-1 ring-slate-200">
  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Forgot your password?</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
    For security, POS passwords are reset by a <strong>System Administrator</strong> or <strong>POS Manager</strong>.
    Ask them to open <em>System → Users</em>, select your account and set a temporary password.
    You can then change it from the settings icon after signing in.
  </p>
  <a href="/login" class="btn btn-secondary mt-6 w-full">Back to sign in</a>
</div>
